/components/*.zip
/components/*.tar
/components/*.tar.gz
/components/*.tgz
/components/*.7z
/components/*.rar

# Changed-files packaging artifacts anywhere
**/*CHANGED_FILES*.zip
**/*CHANGED_FILES*.tar
**/*CHANGED_FILES*.tar.gz
